  "pros": [
    "Streamlined communication and collaboration features like Campfire and @mentions.",
    "Efficient task management with inline editing, quick assignment, and rapid entry of multiple to-dos.",
    "The clear interface helps keep track of multiple projects without feeling overwhelmed."
