  "changed": [
    "Pro 2: Changed from 'Easy to set up and manage project tasks, to-dos, and overall project organization.' to 'Efficient task management with inline editing, quick assignment, and rapid entry of multiple to-dos.' based on multiple benefit notes regarding to-do creation, assignment, and inline editing.",
    "Con 2: Changed from 'Might lack advanced features for highly complex or long-term projects.' to 'Lacks robust calendar or reporting tools for tracking project progress and approvals.' based on notes about 'My Events' not showing to-dos and the absence of an approval status/field on to-dos."
